    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Valeria, a high school student that must work alone and earn enough money to buy more medicine for her sick mother. Experience a paranoia inducing scenario in this PSX-inspired horror game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VALERIA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/179213550049cf75d222a20b1fb146f4.poster.avif?t=1755688675\" width=378 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/179213550049cf75d222a20b1fb146f4.webm?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/179213550049cf75d222a20b1fb146f4.mp4?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Valeria, a young student who recently lost her father, and now has to care for her sick mother by her lonesome. And  with the medicine running out, she must earn enough money to buy said medicine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOTHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/04b435b986c76c012f8e7ad6abd902f9.poster.avif?t=1755688675\" width=380 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/04b435b986c76c012f8e7ad6abd902f9.webm?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/04b435b986c76c012f8e7ad6abd902f9.mp4?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valeria's mother has been suffering from a chronic illness for a long time and is bedridden.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Although she's bedridden most of the time, she only gets up if she wants to go to the bathroom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SHOP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/cec664f4f1d92a36256315223e4ff62e.avif?t=1755688675\" width=380 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luckily, Valeria's neighbor gave her an opportunity to work at his Nasi Goreng shop late at night. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/7ac67b847aa75a2f9f49ee044b422695.poster.avif?t=1755688675\" width=378 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/7ac67b847aa75a2f9f49ee044b422695.webm?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/7ac67b847aa75a2f9f49ee044b422695.mp4?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, she must cook and serve Nasi Goreng to customers and save enough money to buy her mother's medicine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PSX Inspired horror set in the quiet neighborhood in Indonesia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings depending on how you play the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of Horror and Cooking Simulation</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Valeria, a high school student that must work alone and earn enough money to buy more medicine for her sick mother. Experience a paranoia inducing scenario in this PSX-inspired horror game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VALERIA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/179213550049cf75d222a20b1fb146f4.poster.avif?t=1755688675\" width=378 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/179213550049cf75d222a20b1fb146f4.webm?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/179213550049cf75d222a20b1fb146f4.mp4?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Valeria, a young student who recently lost her father, and now has to care for her sick mother by her lonesome. And  with the medicine running out, she must earn enough money to buy said medicine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOTHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/04b435b986c76c012f8e7ad6abd902f9.poster.avif?t=1755688675\" width=380 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/04b435b986c76c012f8e7ad6abd902f9.webm?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/04b435b986c76c012f8e7ad6abd902f9.mp4?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valeria's mother has been suffering from a chronic illness for a long time and is bedridden.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Although she's bedridden most of the time, she only gets up if she wants to go to the bathroom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SHOP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/cec664f4f1d92a36256315223e4ff62e.avif?t=1755688675\" width=380 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luckily, Valeria's neighbor gave her an opportunity to work at his Nasi Goreng shop late at night. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/7ac67b847aa75a2f9f49ee044b422695.poster.avif?t=1755688675\" width=378 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/7ac67b847aa75a2f9f49ee044b422695.webm?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831660/extras/7ac67b847aa75a2f9f49ee044b422695.mp4?t=1755688675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, she must cook and serve Nasi Goreng to customers and save enough money to buy her mother's medicine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PSX Inspired horror set in the quiet neighborhood in Indonesia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings depending on how you play the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of Horror and Cooking Simulation</p></li></ul>",
